[00:00.00] Welcome to live on KEXP.
[00:04.00] We're broadcasting from Seattle Center on 90.3 FM in Seattle,
[00:08.00] 92.7 in the Bay Area, and streaming worldwide on KEXP.org
[00:12.00] and our KEXP apps. We're able to do these kinds of in-studios
[00:16.00] thanks to the support from our generous donors. If you want to join our community, you can go to
[00:20.00] KEXP.org to learn more. I'm DJ Jewel, host of Astral Plane,
[00:24.00] and I'm so excited to be here with Glass Beams. Thanks you guys
[00:28.00] so much for being here. Take it away.
